Require a compact Theta sketch's entries to be in (0, theta) and ordered.

A compact sketch holds hashes in (0, theta), strictly increasing when
ordered. The image was not checked: an entry of 0, found by data.sketches
tools/fuzz, made the compressed serializer compute 0 entry bits and write an
image it then refused to read back.

Also: theta itself must not exceed MAX_THETA (one that did needed 64 entry
bits to compress), and an unordered image may not repeat a hash, since
serializing sorts the entries and then refuses the duplicates. An image
flagged empty may hold no entries.

